# No WorkDSH branding

User-facing copy must never present WorkDSH / workDSH / workdsh as a product name, upstream attribution, or marketing reference.

## Do not write

- Release-note footers such as “开源上游参考：github.com/techflag/workdsh”
- Download / upgrade bullets that name `workdsh-enterprise-connection` or other `workdsh-*` package ids when a plain product phrase works
- README, website, issue, or release prose that points users at techflag/workdsh as the product origin

## Prefer

- Product name: 开物 / 开物Praxis / kaiwu
- Enterprise line: “企业连接另提供独立归档”
- Keep internal package ids, paths, and code symbols unchanged when they are required for builds; do not echo them in user-visible release notes or marketing text
